<main id="main" class="wrap narrow">
  <h1>Thanks for applying!</h1>
  <p class="lede">We'll email you within a few days to tell you more about the beta and to find a time to talk. Places are limited, and we'll let you know either way.</p>
  <p>In the meantime, your <a href="/check/">free personalised checklist</a> shows what to do first. If your wedding is coming up, start with the passport question: your travel bookings must match the name on your passport.</p>
  <p><a href="/">Back to the home page</a></p>
</main>
